{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X 的 S05 只有 18 秒，却集中出现大量未标注“到时出现”的感受短语，容易让感受信息挤占主线；这一屏 Y 更容易消化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的优势不只是重点加亮，而是把叙事拆成容易捕捉的心理节点，再用较小的感受文字补充音乐、身体和情绪的变化；有时间标记的内容还减少了一次性阅读的负担。人物从不敢表达、短暂安心、害怕失去，到愿意承认自己的喜欢，心理转变及其原因都更容易跟上，音乐感受也比 Y 更具体，有力度、呼吸、音色、空间和身体感的层次。Y 的叙事本身并不差，甚至部分屏幕更轻松，但整体更像一段完整解说配一组感受词，X 更容易让普通观众同时听见音乐、理解人物，并感到这些情绪变化为什么发生。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "bdefdd28-6afd-4b81-8bc7-ea4a68860154", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T181955263341Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:21:14.698325+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ce3d6623b30185f59a5b40235ad196a6f8f7e8b690b9aad49c2bc4e4cc44d974", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9